OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe floods restaurant for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FA restaurant owner has said he got
OL,7,F"deja vu" when he was told one of his
OL,8,Fvenues had been flooded after a water
OL,9,Fpipe burst for the second time in three
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FSalique Meah, 38, was alerted by one of
OL,13,Fhis employees at Nellie Restaurant and
OL,14,FBar in Scarisbrick, Lancashire, at
OL,15,Fabout 03:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,17,FHe said the venue was previously
OL,18,Fflooded on 26 June 2023 but this time
OL,19,Fthe damage was worse, with the water up
OL,20,Fto 3ft (0.9m) in places, and there was
OL,21,Fnot a single thing that he could
OL,22,Fsalvage.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
