OL,3,GNEWSABurst pipe floods restaurant for
OL,4,Asecond time
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater firm United Utilities apologised
OL,7,Fto the owners of three properties who
OL,8,Fhad been affected by the flooding -
OL,9,Fwhich was caused by a burst water main-
OL,10,Fand said it was supporting them.
